{"id":"d60e0a36bd259287","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-diamond.md","title":"Diamond Principle","display":"df-diamond — Diamond Principle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-diamond","aliases":["58-df-diamond","58-df-diamond-principle","$\\diamondsuit$ Principle"],"display":"df-diamond — Diamond Principle","depends_on":["[[58-df-stationary]]","[[58-df-omega1]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-diamond"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-diamond</span><span>58-df-diamond-principle</span><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit\">\\(\\diamondsuit\\)</span> Principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diamond — Diamond Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> (first uncountable ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(A,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(A,\\kappa)\\)</span> (stationarity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\">\\(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\)</span> (diamond principle defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diamond} \\vdash \\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:S(\\alpha)=A\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diamond} \\vdash \\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:S(\\alpha)=A\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diamond} \\vdash \\Diamond\\leftrightarrow\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diamond} \\vdash \\Diamond\\leftrightarrow\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-df-diamond-principle</code> is merged here as the general regular-cardinal version of the same diamond principle.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stationary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega1]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1$ (first uncountable ordinal, see [[58-df-omega1]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal"